  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level and every 3 levels thereafter, the duo gains a bonus feat in addition to those gained from normal advancement. These bonus feats must be selected from those listed as teamwork feats. Only one individual needs to meet the prerequisites for the feat. Each member of the pair must agree to select the same teamwork feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/duo#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
